---
title: "SessionProvider inside Suspense, under StrictMode"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: off
    lg1: wait
    lg2: ok
    lg3: busy
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 purple
  s0: Not on the page
  s1: Mounted, no session yet
  s2: New session open, child not drawn yet
  s3: Fallback shows, data loads
  s4: Fallback shows, data loaded
  s5: Child shows the session's data
  s6: Child shows, about to render again
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the page mounts the provider
  s1 --> s2: the effect opens a session
  s2 --> s0: the page removes the provider
  s2 --> s3: the child asks for the session's data and suspends
  s3 --> s0: the page removes the provider
  s3 --> s4: the session's data loads
  s4 --> s0: the page removes the provider
  s4 --> s5: the child shows again
  s5 --> s0: the page removes the provider
  s5 --> s6: the page above re-renders
  s6 --> s0: the page removes the provider
  s6 --> s5: the child renders
  class s0 tan
  class s1 purple
  class s2 purple
  class s3 yellow
  class s4 yellow
  class s5 teal
  class s6 purple
